# Error handling

Read [`skills/error-handling/SKILL.md`](../skills/error-handling/SKILL.md) before writing services or APIs.

- Public failures → `Types.ApiResult<T>` with `#err : Text`
- Validators → pure `?Text` (null = valid)
- Early `return #err(...)` — fail before ledger calls
- Map ledger errors with `TransferError.describe` — no raw traps for user input
- API mixins delegate only; services own all `#err` paths
